The following input formats are supported:
- Discrete point array: `[{x, y}, {x, y}, ...]`
- Single polygon source array: {@link TPCB_PolygonSourceArray}
- Single polygon object: {@link IPCB_Polygon}
- Complex polygon object: {@link IPCB_ComplexPolygon}
- Polygon group: {@link TSYS_MathPolygonGroup}
